        <mxCell id="aniQ9QHuZxmv1DUvEgxf-42" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#66A7E9,#70B2E6);strokeColor=none;align=left;" value="&lt;h2 align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 21px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Step 1: CHOOSE THE AGENTS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Determine the number of humans and robots in your system. Then refer to the AGENTS panel in the left HASIGN Template, and select the corresponding icon and copy and paste it in your DESIGN FRAME. As an example here, we will use one human, and one AGV.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
