        <mxCell id="aniQ9QHuZxmv1DUvEgxf-45" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#66A7E9,#70B2E6);strokeColor=none;align=left;" value="&lt;h2 align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;Step 2: CONNECT THE AGENTS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot; face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;When the interaction is both ways, Connect an arrow from the Human to the AGV agent from the top to represent the human-to-robot interaction. Then do the same with an arrow from the AGV to the Human agent to represent the robot-to-human interaction.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="1260" x="1480" y="340" as="geometry" />
