        <mxCell id="aniQ9QHuZxmv1DUvEgxf-65" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#66A7E9,#70B2E6);strokeColor=none;align=left;" value="&lt;h2 align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;54&quot; data-end=&quot;101&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Step 5: ADD THE TEMPORAL EFFECT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; face=&quot;Verdana&quot;&gt;For each of the interactions, determine whether the information communicated relates to the past, present or future. Then copy and paste from the TEMPORAL EFFECT panel in the HASIGN Template onto each of the interaction icon you’ve placed in DESIGN FRAME. Make sure to place the temporal effect icon at the bottom of each icon. Additionally, the PAST banner should be placed on the left side of the hexagonal icon, the PRESENT banner should be placed in the middle, and the FUTURE banner should be placed on the right side.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
